{"assets":[],"contentKind":"statement","contestId":"1800","diagnostics":[],"document":{"children":[{"attrs":{"level":1,"role":"title"},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"F. Dasha and Nightmares"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"time_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"time limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"4 seconds"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"memory_limit"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"memory limit per test"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"512 megabytes"}],"kind":"container"},{"attrs":{"role":"body"},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Dasha, an excellent student, is studying at the best mathematical lyceum in the country. Recently, a mysterious stranger brought $$$n$$$ words consisting of small latin letters $$$s_1, s_2, \\ldots, s_n$$$ to the lyceum. Since that day, Dasha has been tormented by "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"nightmares"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Consider some pair of integers $$$\\langle i, j \\rangle$$$ ($$$1 \\le i \\le j \\le n$$$). "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"A nightmare"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" is a string for which it is true:"}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"attrs":{"ordered":false},"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" It is obtained by concatenation $$$s_{i}s_{j}$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" Its length is "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"odd"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" The number of different letters in it is "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"exactly"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" $$$25$$$; "}],"kind":"list_item"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":" The number of occurrences of each letter that is in the word is "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"odd"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":". "}],"kind":"list_item"}],"kind":"list"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"For example, if $$$s_i=$$$ \"abcdefg\" and $$$s_j=$$$ \"ijklmnopqrstuvwxyz\", the pair $$$\\langle i, j \\rangle$$$ creates a "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"nightmare"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Dasha will stop having "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"nightmares"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" if she counts their number. There are too many "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"nightmares"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":", so Dasha needs your help. Count the number of different "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"nightmares"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Nightmares"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" are called different if the corresponding pairs $$$\\langle i, j \\rangle$$$ are different. The pairs $$$\\langle i_1, j_1 \\rangle$$$ and $$$\\langle i_2, j_2 \\rangle$$$ are called different if $$$i_1 \\neq i_2$$$ "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"or"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" $$$j_1 \\neq j_2$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"input_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The first line contains a single integer $$$n$$$ ($$$1 \\le n \\le 2 \\cdot 10^5$$$) — the number of words."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"The following $$$n$$$ lines contain the words $$$s_1, s_2, \\ldots, s_n$$$, consisting of small latin letters."}],"kind":"paragraph"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"It is guaranteed that the total length of words does not exceed $$$5 \\cdot 10^6$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"output_specification"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Print a single integer — the number of different "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"nightmares"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":"."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"samples"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Example"}],"kind":"heading"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample"},"children":[{"attrs":{"role":"sample_input"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Input"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n10\nftl\nabcdefghijklmnopqrstuvwxy\nabcdeffghijkllmnopqrsttuvwxy\nffftl\naabbccddeeffgghhiijjkkllmmnnooppqqrrssttuuvvwwxxyy\nthedevid\nbcdefghhiiiijklmnopqrsuwxyz\ngorillasilverback\nabcdefg\nijklmnopqrstuvwxyz\n"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"sample_output"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":3},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Output"}],"kind":"heading"},{"kind":"code_block","text":"\n5\n"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"section"},{"attrs":{"role":"note"},"children":[{"attrs":{"level":2},"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"Note"}],"kind":"heading"},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"In the first test, "},{"children":[{"kind":"text","text":"nightmares"}],"kind":"container"},{"kind":"text","text":" are created by pairs $$$\\langle 1, 3 \\rangle$$$, $$$\\langle 2, 5 \\rangle$$$, $$$\\langle 3, 4 \\rangle$$$, $$$\\langle 6, 7 \\rangle$$$, $$$\\langle 9, 10 \\rangle$$$."}],"kind":"paragraph"}],"kind":"section"}],"kind":"document"},"index":"F","problemCode":"1800F","schema":2,"sourceKind":"html","sourceUrl":"https://codeforces.com/contest/1800/problem/F"}